<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN CRICKET BOARD XI V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN CRICKET BOARD XI V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final</p>
<p>day of the three-day match between a Pakistan Cricket Board</p>
<p>(PCB) XI and New Zealand on Tuesday:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 171 (B. Young 47; Muhammad Zahid</p>
<p>6-54).</p>
<p>PCB XI first innings 193-7 declared.</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings (overnight 34-1)</p>
<p> C.Spearman c Zahoor Elahi b Aaqib Javed	   0</p>
<p> J.Vaughan c Mohammad Wasim b Murtaza Hussain   48</p>
<p> B.Young b Mohammad Zahid			     73</p>
<p> A.Parore c Murtaza Hussain b Mohammad Hussain   4</p>
<p> S.Fleming lbw b Mohammad Zahid		     27</p>
<p> N.Astle not out					  30</p>
<p> M.Greatbatch c subs b Aaqib Javed		   2</p>
<p> G.Larsen b Aaqib Javed				  1</p>
<p> M.Hart not out					    9</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-5 nb-9 w-2)			   17</p>
<p> Total (for seven wickets, declared)	     211</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-6 2-82 3-95 4-156 5-164 6-168 7-170</p>
<p>Bowling: Aaqib Javed 17-3-38-3 (nb3), Mohammad Zahid</p>
<p>18-2-40-2 (nb6), Mohammad Hussain 29-11-66-1, Murtaza Hussain</p>
<p>19-4-61-1 (w2).</p>
<p>PCB XI second innings</p>
<p> Zahoor Elahi not out				   23</p>
<p> Mohammad Wasim not out				 14</p>
<p> Extras (lb-4)					     4</p>
<p> Total (without loss)				   41</p>
<p>Bowling: Doull 4-2-7-0, Larsen 4-1-11-0, Hart 4-0-15-0,</p>
<p>Vaughan 3-1-4-0.</p>
<p>Result: Match drawn</p>
</text>
